  "body": "In ES, the pattern is to allow Set methods of immutable things to succeed if you are setting them to the value that they already are. This is taken by [the SetPrototypeOf method of Immutable Prototype Exotic Objects](https://tc39.github.io/ecma262/#sec-immutable-prototype-exotic-objects-setprototypeof-v). However, WindowProxy and Location have custom SetPrototypeOf methods which simply return false [(ref)](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#location-setprototypeof). Instead, maybe they should refer to the method from ES, as [the named properties object does in WebIDL](https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#named-properties-object-setprototypeof).",
